2. LIBERO demonstration actions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: the LIBERO datasets (Liu, Zhu, Gao, Feng, Liu, Zhu and Stone, "LIBERO: Benchmarking Knowledge Transfer for Lifelong Robot Learning", 2023; https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO), as mirrored in the Hugging Face dataset yifengzhu-hf/LIBERO-datasets.
Where: datasets/{robouse-libero,robouse-libero-90,robouse-core}/*/oracle/demo_actions.json
Changes: the action sequence of one demonstration per task was extracted from the .hdf5 file; the file's "source" and "demo" fields name the file and demonstration.
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. LIBERO's code is MIT (Copyright (c) 2023 Lifelong Robot Learning); no LIBERO code is redistributed here.

