3. D4RL Adroit human demonstrations
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: the D4RL datasets (Fu, Kumar, Nachum, Tucker and Levine, "D4RL: Datasets for Deep Data-Driven Reinforcement Learning", 2020), Adroit "human" demonstrations recorded for DAPG (Rajeswaran et al., 2018), as published in the Farama Minari dataset farama-minari/D4RL.
Where: datasets/robouse-adroit/*/oracle/demo.json
Changes: the action sequence of one episode per task was extracted; the file's "source" field names the dataset, task and episode.
