9. Adapted benchmarks and task designs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Several datasets adapt another benchmark's tasks (their task text names the original environments and describes the goals) and are listed with the original benchmark, organisation, repository and licence in hub.yaml (`upstream`). The adaptations are BenchFlow's; the original authors did not publish or review them. benchflow/robouse-harm is BenchFlow's reproduction of Robocurve's RoboHarm.

